mutation keep one excess archive row
detects CommittedTail
-          /\ rows' = SelectSeq(Append(rows, row), LAMBDA entry: entry.id > row.id - Cap)
+          /\ rows' = SelectSeq(Append(rows, row), LAMBDA entry: entry.id >= row.id - Cap)

mutation retain a failed transaction's inserted row
detects CommittedTail
-    /\ UNCHANGED <<delivery, storage>>
+    /\ rows' = Append(rows, NewRow(item)) /\ UNCHANGED <<delivery, committed>>

mutation an archive failure advances the delivery instead of isolating the error
detects OnlyDeliveryCompletes
-    /\ UNCHANGED <<delivery, storage>>
+    /\ completed' = started /\ UNCHANGED <<started, storage>>

mutation wait for the archive before completing delivery
detects reach:CompletedWithPending
-    /\ completed < started
+    /\ completed < started /\ pending = {}

mutation include the first record from the next day
detects HalfOpenDay
- DayRows == SelectSeq(rows, LAMBDA row: row.at >= DayStart /\ row.at < DayEnd)
+ DayRows == SelectSeq(rows, LAMBDA row: row.at >= DayStart /\ row.at <= DayEnd)

mutation exclude the first record at the selected day's midnight
detects HalfOpenDay
- DayRows == SelectSeq(rows, LAMBDA row: row.at >= DayStart /\ row.at < DayEnd)
+ DayRows == SelectSeq(rows, LAMBDA row: row.at > DayStart /\ row.at < DayEnd)

mutation reverse insertion order for equal timestamps
detects StableNewestOrder
- NewestFirst(a, b) == a.at > b.at \/ (a.at = b.at /\ a.id > b.id)
+ NewestFirst(a, b) == a.at > b.at \/ (a.at = b.at /\ a.id < b.id)

mutation drop the extra row that indicates the next page
detects PageAndLookahead
- Query(offset) == SubSeq(Ordered, offset + 1, Min(Len(Ordered), offset + PageSize + 1))
+ Query(offset) == SubSeq(Ordered, offset + 1, Min(Len(Ordered), offset + PageSize))

mutation start the second page one record too early
detects PageAndLookahead
- Query(offset) == SubSeq(Ordered, offset + 1, Min(Len(Ordered), offset + PageSize + 1))
+ Query(offset) == SubSeq(Ordered, IF offset = 0 THEN 1 ELSE offset, Min(Len(Ordered), offset + PageSize + 1))
